  "question": {
    "text": "The position of a particle related to time is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The magnitude of velocity of the particle at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> s will be :"
